#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:5
#: 2a3508eadcc94cedae6e219fdd1c4658 3cd34550a71448fabe13d6b9eabb2504
#: 6d82f68e57df44e4ae8a3337d2b94932 7609226f8bce4914a9a862718f30ec91
#: 9715e7f006114c8d93e51139ee964a95 a1e2b5ad0792427eb0187df7c5875cf7
msgid "Extended Kalman Filter (EKF)"
msgstr "扩展卡尔曼滤波器（EKF）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:9
#: 4a489d0ef6ed4b488bb46879fdc42dce 4ae8ad015795493aaf63914a48f48411
#: 83fa365662f24144870e1f44473ca1ee 9cbc9fc903ba47f7a0e9cce00ca22dc9
#: d4d9de4a61e44b45a7e0d32ddee468b3 ee399d22a6dd4cbeab23e480b0a97a47
msgid ""
"An Extended Kalman Filter (EKF) algorithm is used to estimate vehicle "
"position, velocity and angular orientation based on rate gyroscopes, "
"accelerometer, compass, GPS, airspeed and barometric pressure measurements."
msgstr "扩展卡尔曼滤波器（EKF）算法基于角速度陀螺仪、加速度计、罗盘、GPS、空速和气压测量数据来估计飞行器的位置、速度和姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:14
#: 045f47fe9fdf4bf9a0cfa8201d2731a5 23ca8c60104346508c4a69d96d551c17
#: 288e40f7e4dc45f99688d680382dc2ac 4df28f2338c94f5aa6b303b63c311ef0
#: c2e928de5bcb4359ae784156e9bf6926 d33022e67e414eef8f3befb9be9c142b
msgid ""
"The advantage of the EKF over the simpler complementary filter algorithms "
"(i.e. \"Inertial Nav\" or DCM), is that by fusing all available measurements"
" it is better able to reject measurements with significant errors. This "
"makes the vehicle less susceptible to faults that affect a single sensor. An"
" EKF also enables measurements from optional sensors such as optical flow "
"and laser range finders to be used to assist navigation."
msgstr ""
"EKF 相较于较简单的互补滤波算法（即「惯性导航」或 "
"DCM）的优势在于，通过融合所有可用测量数据，它能更好地拒绝含有显著误差的测量值，使飞行器不易受到单一传感器故障的影响。EKF "
"还可以融合光流和激光测距仪等可选传感器的测量数据来辅助导航。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:21
#: 0189f7a88ba4463faf027ee86211cd11 1d2ff46a10a44bdb9a8affd30500862e
#: 29c43fbc1e5a4a14a809b2c60d33c034 856fa52a0e844e9db27b9a481ac2a845
#: 9b4bba79a88a431f92d4947e3e4d8067 c96241927ace4303aee0bfc26fb21748
msgid ""
"Current stable versions of ArduPilot use EKF3 as their primary attitude and "
"position estimation source with DCM running quietly in the background. If "
"the autopilot has two (or more) IMUs available, two EKF \"cores\" (i.e. two "
"instances of the EKF) will run in parallel, each using a different IMU. At "
"any one time, only the output from a single EKF core is ever used, that core"
" being the one that reports the best health which is determined by the "
"consistency of its sensor data."
msgstr ""
"当前 ArduPilot 稳定版本使用 EKF3 作为主要姿态和位置估计源，DCM 在后台静默运行。如果飞控具有两个（或更多）IMU，则会并行运行两个 "
"EKF「核」（即两个 EKF 实例），每个使用不同的 IMU。在任意时刻，仅使用单个 EKF 核的输出，即传感器数据一致性最好、健康状态最佳的那个核。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:25
#: 3d64278ac21648c1a2a157caabfeec95 6801cd4afbc741e2815325d067c45caf
#: 875e2ca1c7a8487786acd2563886ecfe af7e740c27fb4571822649047dfa7d19
#: c0418135c4c84b8892d0f7ef6d9c3ef0 f2c8a3a3da414df28cb37202058e3d26
msgid ""
"Most users should not need to modify any EKF parameters, but the information"
" below provides some information on those parameters that are most commonly "
"changed. More detailed information can be found on the :ref:`developer EKF "
"wiki page <dev:extended-kalman-filter>`."
msgstr ""
"大多数用户无需修改任何 EKF 参数，但以下信息介绍了最常修改的参数。更多详细信息请参阅 :ref:`开发者 EKF Wiki 页面 "
"<dev:extended-kalman-filter>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:29
#: 04081d8ac1ae425ab4973789ed7f9fcc 4bc92cb7f5424e4192c5987bdc50b97e
#: 62d8fc24450b4d639ef6cea47f385186 cc4fe6e10814452b9dbc496b7cd5f072
#: efc461a0e9b04882b4bba874557cc061 ff28933246294013934eab8b1933e730
msgid "Should the EKF2 or EKF3 be used?"
msgstr "应使用 EKF2 还是 EKF3？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:31
#: 40ec2f2a61ed446cb0882afce50c6219 696bce8219b047e5acebed59f642858f
#: 946873a121604643a6d9b9c87d9e5481 c679186f81564fa89f16f195fb2345fd
#: dd939ce1d86242da954390684f9f0e37 fa097f800c914969ba4bc0517c05320b
msgid ""
"In general, we recommend users stick with the EKF3, which is now the "
"default. In addition, 1MB autopilots only have this option due to space "
"limitations. EKF2 can still be used but does not have many of the "
"enhancements of EKF3 such as newer sensor sources including Beacons, Wheel "
"Encoders and Visual Odometry."
msgstr ""
"一般而言，我们建议用户坚持使用 EKF3，这已是默认选项。此外，1MB 飞控由于空间限制，只有这一选项。EKF2 仍可使用，但不具备 EKF3 "
"的许多增强功能，例如信标、轮式编码器和视觉里程计等较新的传感器源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:35
#: 2553f3700e3348f59fa135d820fe6c9f 40e246acdfa74ff6b8a92d9443917188
#: 5bfc206551e04af9a63528e3c23aa003 64d96dd4f44d44a8b2484a22fe963508
#: d16ef4dac97f4e79a741144f4147bc08 fba9e7f62fdf47beb664b8f4de55e11f
msgid "Choosing the EKF and number of cores"
msgstr "选择 EKF 和核数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:37
#: 51f73403590d4fe6b3c8f36af788dcf6 6ea738d3213741c9956f914a9dd6df2b
#: 7f80293841554f82a7b48f0001947206 a4a97a609e4842a5be299535af85454c
#: e2f5b0bf113a4eaf92a538a4cf0ea3e0 f4d2fd88ba124145a71659f38695f97a
msgid ""
":ref:`AHRS_EKF_USE <dev:extended-kalman-filter_ahrs_ekf_use>`: set to \"1\" "
"to use the EKF, \"0\" to use DCM for attitude control and ahrs dead "
"reckoning (Plane) for position control.  In Copter this parameter is forced "
"to \"1\" and cannot be changed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AHRS_EKF_USE <dev:extended-kalman-filter_ahrs_ekf_use>`：设置为 「1」使用 "
"EKF，「0」使用 DCM 进行姿态控制，以及 AHRS 航位推算（Plane）进行位置控制。在 Copter 中此参数强制为 「1」，不可更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:39
#: 0e32779f72134721bc2f69e59a2ef96b 15d8520ab7bc4d38a82d0ac71b128de8
#: 5703d9af27ac4783b1f22696d878f17a 84ea44387cf54904b864bf0dca6d90c3
#: d46c54188fb54f83993f842fc59d0653 e5cdc3a078234cafb7e906defad8f9f4
msgid ""
":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <AHRS_EKF_TYPE>`: set to \"2\" to use EKF2 for attitude "
"and position estimation, \"3\" for EKF3."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <AHRS_EKF_TYPE>`：设置为 「2」使用 EKF2 进行姿态和位置估计，「3」使用 EKF3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:41
#: 66752894a21b451888155c6d64889d7a 8092ca6e9097470fb701242c2b78d7d8
#: 9114b78573464da0aaa26785236f474e ae93095b0d4841108a33002296e3f486
#: b7d847ae8b464f3eac7d9d41682899ba ec6afc0fcf444425aa4470fd6ec961ce
msgid ""
":ref:`EK2_ENABLE <EK2_ENABLE>`, :ref:`EK3_ENABLE <EK3_ENABLE>`: set to \"1\""
" to enable the EKF2 and/or EKF3 respectively."
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK2_ENABLE <EK2_ENABLE>`、:ref:`EK3_ENABLE <EK3_ENABLE>`：分别设置为 「1」以启用 "
"EKF2 和/或 EKF3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:43
#: 0539f26c67e54852ad0ba6c681afc119 2126eb762f5740298cc8e5f04119f391
#: 41020368ea6a419c82c82ea5cfce871c 71332da79924436cad6eaf4c80137f58
#: 71f717d122fa42d6888cd7ce466f62ef 882dd15c0f70447ea22b0474f4e73d22
msgid ""
":ref:`EK2_IMU_MASK <EK2_IMU_MASK>`, :ref:`EK3_IMU_MASK <EK3_IMU_MASK>`: a "
"bitmask specifying which IMUs (i.e. accelerometer/gyro) to use.  An EKF "
"\"core\" (i.e. a single EKF instance) will be started for each IMU "
"specified."
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK2_IMU_MASK <EK2_IMU_MASK>`、:ref:`EK3_IMU_MASK <EK3_IMU_MASK>`：指定使用哪些"
" IMU（即加速度计/陀螺仪）的位掩码。每个指定的 IMU 将启动一个 EKF「核」（即单个 EKF 实例）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:45
#: 094d973177d942f6a0e5ed3866861077 1fb85364e3ef4eb8b407882bc6983714
#: 307c223d669c4054b01535f3e47a9989 493616ccce154f3dbb1597a6b7136316
#: 52bdd9c535b0459da8598535faf12a6d b28188c7ac964b3b95952036e00a7461
msgid "1: starts a single EKF core using the first IMU"
msgstr "1：使用第一个 IMU 启动单个 EKF 核"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:46
#: 1be48433d2b84cd9bfeac630f12336c2 26536bad40124d309c7df6f7494f3661
#: bef055b570994d549fda9030b8758a23 d0027f1390d24827975961e060f8776a
#: d93a3fdc86d44dfd9a35fd26d67e0c0c fe343e54d1354e708657a23c4f6d0da0
msgid "2: starts a single EKF core using only the second IMU"
msgstr "2：仅使用第二个 IMU 启动单个 EKF 核"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:47
#: 1f4323a1d763444d8088340ef021fce6 6c8cab051bd34c14b9237605d23f3b92
#: 9df0b3914b534cb0a2d0332e4f7eba91 c3c966e088c34f15add179e191a3a740
#: e4caf61ce9f74bfeaf12bc60426fe4e6 e61fc42ce90a4b30a5a23943a81bac0e
msgid ""
"3: starts two separate EKF cores using the first and second IMUs "
"respectively"
msgstr "3：分别使用第一和第二个 IMU 启动两个独立的 EKF 核"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:49
#: 635bb1828bc345f9ae696e87f1a6586c 94dd5f3682254630882dd5ae299ac69b
#: b43ccf40f5344a2d8356957d3e24b5de bf3e92baa8724dbf8213f88297d93f78
#: dabed2547a13497e8eecf15f917ef538 ff8c347b6629433eb90703c082c25669
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_PRIMARY<EK3_PRIMARY>`: selects which \"core\" or \"lane\" is used "
"as the primary. A value of 0 selects the first IMU lane in the "
":ref:`EK3_IMU_MASK <EK3_IMU_MASK>`, 1 the second, etc. Be sure that the "
"selected primary lane exists. See Affinity and Lane Switching below."
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_PRIMARY<EK3_PRIMARY>`：选择哪个「核」或「通道」作为主通道。值 0 选择 :ref:`EK3_IMU_MASK "
"<EK3_IMU_MASK>` 中第一个 IMU 通道，1 选择第二个，依此类推。请确保所选主通道存在。参见下方的亲和性与通道切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:53
#: 0cec4da3abe54d8b9f2a0aa8727e9ccd 1206c30ebfc64da59bda005b4f564cf0
#: 3eac08f0b9d64b1fb0dedb5c369a28ee 4956e5155b504860967e80457ae9b53f
#: 6eb9897fbc7849e380164c6bf0f1dff7 9fad77cb2a7e439f9a770813555b6384
msgid ""
"Plane and Rover will fall back from EKF2 or EKF3 to DCM if the EKF becomes "
"unhealthy or the EKF is not fusing GPS data despite the GPS having 3D Lock. "
"There is no fallback from EKF3 to EKF2 (or EKF2 to EKF1)"
msgstr ""
"如果 EKF 变得不健康，或 EKF 在 GPS 具有 3D 锁定的情况下仍无法融合 GPS 数据，Plane 和 Rover 将从 EKF2 或 "
"EKF3 回退到 DCM。不支持从 EKF3 回退到 EKF2（或从 EKF2 回退到 EKF1）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:58
#: 223fe4187c9345228787d21233fa73ef 30581d1fe7a144d6ac9d58af8ed60d74
#: 5cbe3630a58d438aac1df94119d405b5 7928a05346d1408d8272952373d7c105
#: c5892bbe035e49c392fbd5d8a68dc149 fc964b0035a14e14bcf96baf5c8a07d0
msgid ""
"Using the parameters above it is possible to run up to 5 AHRSs in parallel "
"at the same time (DCMx1, EKF2x2, EKF3x2) but this can result in performance "
"problems so if running EKF2 and EKF3 in parallel, set the IMU_MASK to reduce"
" the total number of cores."
msgstr ""
"使用上述参数，最多可同时并行运行 5 个 AHRS（DCMx1、EKF2x2、EKF3x2），但这可能导致性能问题，因此如果同时运行 EKF2 和 "
"EKF3，请设置 IMU_MASK 以减少核的总数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:61
#: 070971045ddb40ffabc0f5aa491b73da 50273cddd67641e3b705cacb1058c80e
#: 654a378d45c6467f9563d9c888406a04 69d39c1949cb43688f5c52011693b369
#: 8c21071a1030494fbf003d7548ad64be 9b647b0d6fcb455a8bca206f3b04a312
msgid "Affinity and Lane Switching"
msgstr "亲和性与通道切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:63
#: 2ba1458c086644319b0c404e4d562ac1 4a672af83da149f881832caf8da1120f
#: 798598d2053c45b780e0bd8a6f4d3eb1 9c469bb0c5464f6191eefe09f7b4de3b
#: a753d8344bcb422792f89b3ec51a2a48 e4b88852066c4f8cab0aeebe3958795d
msgid ""
"EKF3 provides the feature of sensor affinity which allows the EKF cores to "
"also use non-primary instances of sensors, specifically, Airspeed, "
"Barometer, Compass (Magnetometer) and GPS. This allows the vehicle to better"
" manage good quality sensors and be able to switch lanes accordingly to use "
"the best-performing one for state estimation. For more details and "
"configuration, refer :ref:`EKF3 Affinity and Lane Switching <common-"
"ek3-affinity-lane-switching>`."
msgstr ""
"EKF3 提供传感器亲和性功能，允许 EKF 核使用非主实例的传感器，具体包括空速、气压计、罗盘（磁力计）和 "
"GPS。这使飞行器能够更好地管理高质量传感器，并相应地切换通道以使用性能最佳的传感器进行状态估计。更多详情和配置请参阅 :ref:`EKF3 "
"亲和性与通道切换 <common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:66
#: 5067b2c470af44309a752dfede1a4f85 54ad2dd3da6940579ef25321bf663608
#: aabf64b4eb3a4a999b72a210b454a567 c6144f8b697d40d18a7d3f8489328b70
#: e84004e4c0e74181a63672e992bf98d7 f524cba08990448ea1ef2bdd5429e762
msgid "GPS / Non-GPS Transitions"
msgstr "GPS / 非 GPS 切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:68
#: 221fe1183ecb488ba7b4885b70e83417 2de59add22fc47558c613b24696c740e
#: 78f0827d65a9406d91e1c20ef32e4d95 78f4cda8cf774c5aa9de3518b327d330
#: 8459a5bed7b1491aad98b772a313c0b2 ba415e53b3154fddbe42324234c187db
msgid ""
"EKF3 supports in-flight switching of sensors which can be useful for "
"transitioning between GPS and Non-GPS environments.  See :ref:`GPS / Non-GPS"
" Transitions <common-non-gps-to-gps>` for more details."
msgstr ""
"EKF3 支持飞行中切换传感器，这对于在 GPS 和非 GPS 环境之间转换很有用。详见 :ref:`GPS / 非 GPS 切换 <common-"
"non-gps-to-gps>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:71
#: 00aa8ed4f41d4ef6b71a1be81a07f78d 48fc3b30386841e68c947cf3295ca4a8
#: 4ccec6b415c548c0991d0a6ccb7f92bb 919fc249bf3a4a64968e9b812dd658ed
#: becbc832867541c6bab161c7e8d45027 f8fb39d9ced14f9285f116ec9b3b4d14
msgid "Commonly modified parameters"
msgstr "常用修改参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:73
#: 159ce732656843bcae57b49404b85d5d 33811a1f717642f7821325dcf55a131d
#: 556efda691144af2a1122fd53e69d4b5 6a84909110af4b11939367d9d8372cea
#: 8c6f92f7d8814dc385ae52c65877d4d6 c0bbb5658c6849859fb4cad308c4e086
msgid "EKF sensor sources, see :ref:`common-ekf-sources`."
msgstr "EKF 传感器源，参见 :ref:`common-ekf-sources`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:75
#: 990860db32ba48b8be2ddc71953caa0e b3d9f3d81770445a9f4a5ddeac902f6c
#: bb35cbde9bbd4f14b1d6cf71d39e4bf7 c8b0d5a2192a4b799091af22d4d7537c
#: cdc8a532c8d54d89985d65740979da02 e88ab46067374c2bb368835a600251b6
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_ALT_M_NSE <dev:extended-kalman-filter_ekf_alt_noise>`: Default is "
"\"1.0\".  Lower number reduces reliance on accelerometers, increases "
"reliance on barometer."
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_ALT_M_NSE <dev:extended-kalman-filter_ekf_alt_noise>`：默认值为 "
"「1.0」。数值越小，对加速度计的依赖越低，对气压计的依赖越高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:77
#: 0ada5bb875d24015b44f0a2fd0ada875 2f881c542c0e4b6ca3774b2d81b2313d
#: 4e26adfe26f34c79ad669bd626471e6e 64b97d8544984599b1157a3a6421fc05
#: 76e1a0a2d9ea4c91821e45d76c5a3dd5 ce27963fe81f4fcbaab61d4957317b36
msgid ""
":ref:`EK3_GPS_TYPE <dev:extended-kalman-filter_ekf_gps_type>`: Controls how "
"GPS is used."
msgstr ""
":ref:`EK3_GPS_TYPE <dev:extended-kalman-filter_ekf_gps_type>`：控制 GPS 的使用方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:80
#: 27b3ed2bbd8a498289652c9d6b073b2a 54a5a840904243ccbcea6bd7c4498253
#: 8d517e8101124bb0b7906ab1030a496d b30692287c514510971410c01139923a
#: ccf984eac10a47f4bccb9aead4e773b5 fe8ae856f6cc476caaea9da5fae22492
msgid "0 : use 3D velocity & 2D position from GPS"
msgstr "0：使用 GPS 的三维速度和二维位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:81
#: 38be7454917f40899c1e96abb6011705 42725a0858454fada79a7e0f736f871f
