msgid ""
"As mentioned above, a more detailed overview of EKF theory and tuning "
"parameters is available on the developer wiki's :ref:`Extended Kalman Filter"
" Navigation Overview and Tuning <dev:extended-kalman-filter>`."
msgstr ""
"如上所述，EKF 理论和调参参数的更详细概述可在开发者 Wiki 的 :ref:`扩展卡尔曼滤波器导航概述与调参 <dev:extended-"
"kalman-filter>` 中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:92
#: 0f994c9fe6c9420b845e231c84212952 aefa2d1afc004743a820f65c16bc25ac
msgid "EKF3 Fallback to DCM"
msgstr "EKF3 回退至 DCM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:94
#: a9883e8457a54f238cc1bb85ef3dae6f b11b0bea27d74744bc7994cd9886e8a2
msgid ""
"In ArduPlane, the older filter (DCM) is used as a fallback if the EKF3 stops"
" using GPS (ie does not think that the GPS is providing accurate position "
"and velocity) but the GPS is still reporting a 3D lock. In this case, "
"ArduPlane switches to the DCM filter as its position, velocity, and attitude"
" estimator. This is indicated by a GCS message that DCM has now become "
"active."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPlane 中，如果 EKF3 停止使用 GPS（即认为 GPS 未提供准确的位置和速度）但 GPS "
"仍然报告三维锁定，则使用旧的滤波器（DCM）作为备用。在这种情况下，ArduPlane 切换到 DCM "
"滤波器作为其位置、速度和姿态估计器。地面站会显示一条消息，表明 DCM 现已激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:96
#: 2e9296695b3d405584a71509537b265c 5ab5ca3cd8ef49b4803ec582ada80e12
msgid ""
"The reasons why EKF3 may start rejecting GPS are varied (but still have GPS "
"3D lock), but include GPS jamming, high vibrations making the EKF3 think it "
"has moved to a different position inertially than GPS reports, etc."
msgstr ""
"EKF3 可能开始拒绝 GPS 的原因多种多样（但仍有 GPS 三维锁定），包括 GPS 干扰、高震动使 EKF3 认为其惯性位置与 GPS "
"报告的不同等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:98
#: 9018c2ac69a649b2a72e3a80ba047033 c255da0d7e0845c69cbae1dd2aef6aaa
msgid ""
"Using DCM (if GPS is indeed still accurate) as a fallback filter is not a "
"real issue for fixed wing flight. It was the original ArduPlane inertial "
"navigation algorithm. For VTOL QuadPlane hovering modes, it is more "
"problematic, since DCM does not consider velocities in its estimator, so "
"hovering is less accurate."
msgstr ""
"如果 GPS 确实仍然准确，使用 DCM 作为备用滤波器对于固定翼飞行来说并不是真正的问题。它是 ArduPlane 最初的惯性导航算法。对于 VTOL"
" 四旋翼飞机的悬停模式，问题更多，因为 DCM 在其估计器中不考虑速度，所以悬停精度较低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:100
#: 027d92ef806348e1b460931339687dc0 27bdc7097ea54e96a65d804faab57ac3
msgid ""
"If DCM fallback is observed, it would be worthwhile to determine the root "
"cause and address it, since this is not a desired operating mode."
msgstr "如果观察到 DCM 备用，值得确定根本原因并加以解决，因为这不是期望的运行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-apm-navigation-extended-kalman-filter-overview.rst:102
#: 9ed8cc32e6f84af4bed7fb50627662f4 e1bbf0204ac64401aa9cc820f780600a
msgid ""
"However, in some situations where GPS lock is valid, but the GPS may give "
"incorrect data leading to DCM being worse than just using EKF3 without GPS "
"(for example, GPS jamming environments), you may wish to prevent fallback to"
" DCM. This can be accomplished using the bits in the "
":ref:`AHRS_OPTIONS<AHRS_OPTIONS>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"然而，在某些情况下，GPS 锁定有效但 GPS 可能给出不正确数据，导致 DCM 比直接使用没有 GPS 的 EKF3 更差（例如 GPS "
"干扰环境），你可能希望防止回退到 DCM。这可以通过 :ref:`AHRS_OPTIONS<AHRS_OPTIONS>` 参数中的位来实现。"
